The IntelForm design system is EzyStudio's own work: the palettes, semantic tokens, type scale
and pairings, shape and border rules, the motion vocabulary (src/styles/motion.css), the
components in src/components/ds, and the rulebook (docs/DESIGN.md).

It is built on the open-source software and fonts below. Each is used under its own licence,
whose full text ships with the package in node_modules (or at the URL given for the fonts).
Keep this file, and those licence texts, with any copy or redistribution of this code.

